'''Ascalon''' is a spear-like artifact first seen in [[The Fire of Georgiopolis]]. According to [[Gil]], if [[the Organization]] had been able to get ahold of it, the [[Huntik Foundation]] would have been in real trouble. The spear is split in two items: a spearhead and a lance.{{source|The Fire of Georgiopolis}}
